	teaches the stat it used, and counts toward your next rank.

	Keep these short: a name, one line, a line for winning and one for losing.
	Nothing here may name a thing that only exists in one age, except in a family whose careers
	only exist in that age (the L Corp works, the Limbus assignments).
]]

